{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator", "label": "Hosting the calculator (retired 2026-09-03)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ran on Cloud Run in three regions 2026-08-25 to 2026-09-03; deploy.yml and remotes block gone; project calculator-506614 resources to be deleted; kept as the record of what was decided and measured."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_resolver_needs_invokeremote", "label": "Finding 1.1: declaring a remote permits egress; invokeRemote attaches the token", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "callCalculator used plain fetch against CALCULATOR_URL and would have received no token; fixed with invokeRemote and operations: [compute]."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_tenant_claim_nested", "label": "Finding 1.2: the tenant claim is nested at app.installationId", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A flat claims.get rejected 100% of genuine traffic while twelve rejection cases passed; _claim_at walks a dotted path."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_clock_skew_leeway", "label": "Finding 1.3: 30 s leeway exceeds a 25 s token life", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Left at 30 until a real token measures the lifetime; a margin cut to fit a sample rejects real traffic at the tail."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_cloud_run_recommendation", "label": "Recommendation: Cloud Run, request billing, min-instances=0, two regions, forge-token", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Chosen on a genuine scale-to-zero, the container shipping unchanged, and Forge doing tenant\u2192region routing; not on price."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_forge_token_auth", "label": "Auth: forge-token, and it is no longer close", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Residency routing needs invokeRemote which attaches the FIT; the mode holds no secret; shared-secret kept for testing."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_cost_model", "label": "Cost: ~$0.15, $0.30, $3.70 a month across three tiers", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Egress overtakes compute at the top tier; min-instances=1 at $9.86/region is the only expensive option."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_runners_up", "label": "Runners-up: Lambda, Fly.io, Azure Container Apps, App Runner, Fargate", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Lambda needs a WSGI adapter; Fly fails procurement; Azure indistinguishable; App Runner floors while idle; Fargate structurally disqualified."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_data_residency_forge_routes", "label": "Data residency: Forge does the routing", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Region-keyed baseUrl resolved at install time; operations: [compute] declares no storage and keeps PINNED eligibility; EU means Frankfurt (europe-west3)."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_no_ip_allow_list", "label": "No IP allow-listing", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Atlassian recommends against region ranges; the invocation token is the gate."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_latency_budget", "label": "The latency budget: 25 s timeout equals the 25 s token life", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A cold start spends the token's validity; intake.sequence must not be wired to a 5 s scheduled trigger."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_healthz_unreachable", "label": "/healthz is swallowed by Google's front end", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The deploy probe uses /v1/meta expecting 401, which also proves authentication is on."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_cold_start_measured", "label": "Cold start measured: 1.15 s US, 0.39 s EU", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Half a second of overhead against a 25 s budget; min-instances=0 stays."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_no_secrets", "label": "Secrets: there are none", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Four FORGE_* values are public configuration; FORGE_AUDIENCE set from a GitHub variable; Isolated Cloud out of scope."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_hostnames", "label": "Hostnames: *.run.app permanently", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Decided 2026-08-31 with ADR 0030's stronger argument."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_weekly_rebuild", "label": "Rebuild cadence: weekly Mondays 03:00 UTC, and it deploys", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A rebuild that never ships is theatre; the running service ages regardless."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_scan_policy", "label": "Scan policy: fixable HIGH/CRITICAL block; unfixable printed", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Actionability not severity; --ignore-unfixed alone is a silent cap so the full picture is printed too; a red gate on 2026-08-28 was working."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_observability", "label": "Observability: counts, never content", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Access log holds method, path, status, issue count, duration, installation ARI; _Default bucket 30 days; alert on 5xx only."}, {"id": "docs_hosting_the_calculator_switchover", "label": "The switchover in order", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/hosting-the-calculator.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Provision, push, confirm hostin